<title>UK: TENNIS-MIXED DOUBLES RESULTS AT WIMBLEDON.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MIXED DOUBLES RESULTS AT WIMBLEDON.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mixed doubles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Monday:</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>Leander Paes (India)/Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Chris</p>
<p>Wilkinson (Britain)/Samantha Smith (Britain) 4-6 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Neil Broad (Britain)/Mariaan De Swardt (South Africa) beat Dave</p>
<p>Randall (U.S.)/Danielle Jones (Australia) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>T.J. Middleton (U.S.)/Lori McNeil (U.S.) beat Stephen Noteboom</p>
<p>(Netherlands)/Sonya Jeyaseelan (Canada) 7-6 (7-4) 7-5</p>
<p>8-Mark Knowles (Bahamas)/Anna Kournikova (Russia) beat Scott</p>
<p>Melville (U.S.)/Nicole Pratt (Australia) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>5-Rick Leach (U.S.)/Manon Bollegraf (Netherlands) beat Roger</p>
<p>Smith (Bahamas)/Amy Frazier (U.S.) 6-1 2-6 6-2</p>
<p>Marius Barnard (South Africa)/Kristie Boogert (Netherlands)</p>
<p>beat Greg Van Emburgh (U.S.)/Eva Melicharova (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-2 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Daniel Orsanic (Argentina)/Florencia Labat (Argentina) beat</p>
<p>Jack Waite (U.S.)/Maja Muric (Croatia) 6-4 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Kent Kinnear (U.S.)/Nana Miyagi (Japan) beat Piet Norval (South</p>
<p>Africa)/Liezel Horn (South Africa) 7-6 (7-1) 6-3</p>
<p>7-David Adams (South Africa)/Alexandra Fusai (France) beat</p>
<p>Kevin Ullyett (South Africa)/Rosalyn Nideffer (South Africa) 6-7</p>
<p>(2-7) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Peter Nyborg (Sweden)/Asa Carlsson (Sweden) beat Rikard Bergh</p>
<p>(Sweden)/Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) 7-5 5-7 6-4</p>
<p>4-Cyril Suk (Czech Republic)/Helena Sukova (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>beat Trevor Kronemann (U.S.)/Kathy Rinaldi Stunkel (U.S.) 6-1</p>
<p>7-5</p>
