<p>(Zimbabwe)/Ann Grossman (U.S.) 4-6 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Kelly Jones (U.S.)/Kristine Kunce (Australia) beat Brent</p>
<p>Haygarth (South Africa)/Tami Jones (U.S.) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Danny Sapsford (Britain)/Shirli-Ann Siddall (Britain) beat</p>
<p>Sander Groen (Netherlands)/Helena Vildova (Czech Republic) 7-5</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Max Mirnyi (Belarus)/Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat 9-Joshua</p>
<p>Eagle (Australia)/Caroline Vis (Netherlands) 7-6 (7-3) 6-4</p>
<p>Wayne Arthurs (Australia)/Tina Krizan (Slovenia) beat</p>
<p>Aleksandar Kitinov (Macedonia)/Aleksandra Olsza (Poland) 7-5 1-6</p>
<p>11-9</p>
<p>13-Luke Jensen (U.S.)/Katrina Adams (U.S.) beat Andrew Florent</p>
<p>(Australia)/Catherine Barclay (Australia) 6-7 (6-8) 6-1 13-11</p>
